# matrices.si — matrix operations example
# Demonstrates matrix indexing, addition, multiplication, and transpose.
# Key components: two-by-two matrix values and operators.
# Matrix indexing, addition, multiplication, and transpose
left is matrix [[1, 2], [3, 4]]
right is matrix [[5, 6], [7, 8]]

Sayln left[0, 1]
Sayln left + right
Sayln left multiply right
Sayln left transpose
